-b378-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"細柳原","place_name_jianti_auto":"细柳原","start_index":165,"tongjian_id":"8f0a4982-db0e-11ef-a3f1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"項羽以河內郡爲殷國；高帝滅殷，復置河內郡。服虔曰：細柳在長安西北。如淳曰：長安細柳倉在渭北，近石徼。張揖曰：在昆明池南，今有柳市是也。臣瓚曰：一宿曰宿，再宿曰信，過信爲次。師古曰：匈奴傳云：置三將軍，軍長安西細柳、渭北棘門、霸上，此則細柳不在渭北，揖說是也。索隱曰：按三輔故事：細柳在直城門外阿房宮西北維。舊唐書：肅宗母元獻楊后葬細柳原。","note_content_jianti_auto":"项羽以河内郡为殷国；高帝灭殷，复置河内郡。服虔曰：细柳在长安西北。如淳曰：长安细柳仓在渭北，近石徼。张揖曰：在昆明池南，今有柳市是也。臣瓒曰：一宿曰宿，再宿曰信，过信为次。师古曰：匈奴传云：置三将军，军长安西细柳、渭北棘门、霸上，此则细柳不在渭北，揖说是也。索隐曰：按三辅故事：细柳在直城门外阿房宫西北维。旧唐书：肃宗母元献杨后葬细柳原。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":87,"tongjian_id":"8f0a4962-db0e-11ef-99a5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"徐厲","people_name_jianti_auto":"徐厉","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8f0a4988-db0e-11ef-9b48-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"高祖","people_name_jianti_auto":"高祖","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8f0a4989-db0e-11ef-8824-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"呂后","people_name_jianti_auto":"吕后","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8f0a498a-db0e-11ef-8184-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"祝茲侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"祝兹侯","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"8f0a498b-db0e-11ef-b7f9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"8f0a498c-db0e-11ef-907a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孟康","people_name_jianti_auto":"孟康","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"8f0a498d-db0e-11ef-b0a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"如淳","people_name_jianti_auto":"如淳","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"8f0a498e-db0e-11ef-98c7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8f0a498f-db0e-11ef-b3e3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8f0a4990-db0e-11ef-9f06-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"松滋縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"松滋县","start_ind